  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-13444\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><ul>\n<li>Statement I is true. We can't draw a straight line that passes through these three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-13444-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-13444-e-0\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Statement II is true. There is a straight line that passes through these three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-13444-e-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-13444-e-1\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Statement III is false. There is a straight line that passes through these three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-13444-e-2\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-13444-e-2\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"</p>\n</div>",
